", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "H\u1ed3 s\u01a1 nghi\u1ec7m thu b\u1ed5 sung cho #1319 (Packet #1319), c\u00f9ng c\u00e1c packet con tr\u00ean c\u00f9ng nh\u00e1nh. **C\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed5i m\u00e3** trong skill `proxima-control`. Kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 t\u1ec7p n\u00e0o n\u1eb1m trong `RELEASE_MANIFEST.json`.\n\n## M\u00e3 (`.agents/skills/proxima-control/`)\n- `scripts/ProximaActivation.psm1` v\u00e0 `tests/ProximaActivation.Tests.ps1`: WP-PXA #1401, review 2/2 `approve_scoped`. G\u1ed3m h\u00e0ng r\u00e0o promote, profile guard, ki\u1ec3m c\u00e2y artifact.\n- `scripts/ProximaInstall.psm1` v\u00e0 `tests/ProximaInstall.Tests.ps1`: WP-PXU #1409, `Remove-ProximaUninstallResidue`.\n  - Review g2 `approve_scoped`.\n  - Desktop 31/32 ca; VM 32/32 \u00b7 42/42 ca, g\u1ed3m c\u1ea3 symlink.\n  - \u0110\u00e3 ch\u1ea1y m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n tr\u00ean OS th\u1eadt sau m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n g\u1ee1 th\u1eadt (WP-PXR #1416).\n- `SKILL.md`: m\u1ee5c \"G\u1ee1 c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t (Uninstall residue)\".\n\n## H\u1ed3 s\u01a1 (`ops/`)\n- `ops/acceptance/wp1319/`: `MATRIX.md` (\u00a711, U1\u2013U12, c\u00e1c m\u1ee5c H.1\u2013H.12), `DESIGN.md`, v\u00e0 c\u00e1c l\u01b0\u1ee3t r1\u2013r4.\n- `ops/acceptance/wp-{pxa,nsis,pxu,u8,pxl,pxr}/`: RESULTS v\u00e0 VERDICT. M\u1ed7i VERDICT k\u00e8m nguy\u00ean v\u0103n verdict c\u1ee7a reviewer v\u00e0 sha256 c\u1ee7a n\u00f3.\n- `ops/specs/*` (\u0111\u1eb7c t\u1ea3 \u0111\u00f3ng b\u0103ng) v\u00e0 `ops/leases/*`. M\u1ecdi lease \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u00e3 thu h\u1ed3i.\n\n## Tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i c\u00e1c packet\n| Packet | K\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 |\n|---|---|\n| #1401 WP-PXA | `approve_scoped` |\n| #1405 WP-NSIS | H\u00e0ng \"g\u1ee1 c\u1ee7a nh\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p\" gi\u1eef **failed** (finding NSIS-2). H\u00e0ng \"quy tr\u00ecnh g\u1ee1\" **passed (scoped)** nh\u1edd #1416 |\n| #1409 WP-PXU | `approve_scoped` + VM PASS |\n| #1410 WP-U8 | V\u1ebf d\u1eef li\u1ec7u passed (h\u1eb9p). V\u1ebf \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp `quan_sat`: phi\u00ean gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c qua backup/restore |\n| #1413 WP-PXL | LIVE promote 2 module l\u00ean Desktop v\u00e0 VM, `approve_with_fixes` |\n| #1416 WP-PXR | G\u1ee1 Proxima tr\u00ean Desktop, `CLEANED`, profile th\u1eed \u0111\u00e3 xo\u00e1, `approve_scoped` |\n\n## C\u00f2n m\u1edf (ghi trong MATRIX)\n- Ph\u1ea7n l\u1edbn h\u00e0ng \u00a711/U ch\u1edd g\u00f3i raw cu\u1ed1i 13/11.\n- Driver PXL v\u00e0 PXR c\u00f3 P1 ph\u1ea3i s\u1eeda tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi d\u00f9ng l\u1ea1i.\n- C\u00e1c ca ch\u01b0a \u0111o c\u1ee7a WP-PXU: UNC th\u1eadt.\n\n## CI\n- C\u00e1c check \u0111\u1ecf c\u0169 \u0111\u00e3 gi\u1ea3i th\u00edch trong comment c\u1ee7a PR.\n- `gate (ubuntu-latest)` t\u1eebng \u0111\u1ecf do t\u1ec7p `ops/land/pr1386-*` tr\u00ean master, kh\u00f4ng do diff n\u00e0y.\n\n---\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_015GtxrapMSm976JLC7Fp1HM", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2026-11-17T16:31:59Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-19T10:40:55Z", "closed_at": "2026-11-19T10:40:55Z", "merged_at": "2026-11-19T10:40:55Z", "merge_commit_sha": "96b6a33d770f7539a3eacbebdc215f87ded4ea7f", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "ducthangho:ccr-8ee03d7f-vnmqk0", "ref": "ccr-8ee03d7f-vnmqk0", "repo": {"id": 1289195917, "node_id": "R_kgDOTNeRjQ", "name": "tra-luat", "full_name": "ducthangho/tra-luat", "owner": {"login": "ducthangho", "id": 12748935, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzQ4OTM1", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12748935?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho", "html_url": "https://github.com/ducthangho", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_